sequenceDiagram
    participant Frontend as StudyStore
    participant Backend as SubjectsAPI

    Frontend->>Backend: GET /api/knowledge-graph?subject=transport
    Backend->>Backend: 从 KNOWLEDGE_GRAPH 过滤 group=5 的 nodes 和关联 edges
    Backend-->>Frontend: {nodes: [...], edges: [...]}
    Frontend->>Frontend: 返回 KnowledgeGraphData

    Note over Frontend: 若后端不可用，回退到本地 knowledgeGraph 数据
